# 📌 Featured Projects

## 🔹 SRAM Controller ASIC Design
Complete RTL-to-GDSII ASIC implementation with timing closure and DRC clean design using Cadence Innovus & Genus.

### Key Achievements
- Reduced ~7800 DRC violations to 0
- Improved setup timing violations significantly
- Achieved hold-clean design
- Clock skew optimized to ~0.020 ns

---

## 🔹 ChipTop ASIC Physical Design
Full Physical Design implementation including Floorplanning, Macro Placement, CTS, Routing, Timing Analysis, and QoR optimization using Cadence Innovus.

---

## 🔹 ALU16 PPA Optimization (OpenLane)
16-bit ALU implementation using OpenLane Sky130 with timing-driven PPA optimization and successful RTL-to-GDSII flow completion.

---

## 🔹 Elevator Control System using Verilog HDL
FSM-based Elevator Control System with Python Tkinter GUI integration for real-time visualization.

